      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Sorry I never got around to this, but it seems to be fixed in the latest releases.\n\nI don't have a photo on hand, but the way the detail is set up, the locket looks like a white-gold, but the detail in brighter conditions shows up giving it a static iridescence.\n\nIn the broken preview, instead it was applying the detail as an albedo to half the locket, and made the other half completely white.",
